        "identifier": "https://github.com/FawadHa1der/theorem-atlas/blob/28bb3f0955086675388e57bc3209f3f7f6eeff4d/CommonGround/Verification/TheoremAtlasQuantumStabilizerLaflammeFiveQubitSingletonNoCloningAndMacWilliamsBridge.lean",
        "note": "eastin_knill_steane_transversal_clifford_closure_vs_single_qubit_logical_barrier: bit-level checks by decide on the Steane, [[4,2,2]] and [[5,1,3]] codes, named after Eastin-Knill; not a statement of the theorem.",
        "relationship": "independent"
      },
